<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1340] Make LuceneSegment* tests work with both Hadoop 1 and 2</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1340</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hadoop changed a few classes to interfaces between Hadoop 1 and Hadoop 2. A couple of these classes are used in the LuceneSegment unit tests. A little bit of simple reflection abstracts these differences away and makes these tests pass under both Hadoop 1 and Hadoop 2.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
