                            <comment id="13776263" author="hudson" created="Tue, 24 Sep 2013 12:54:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;SUCCESS: Integrated in Mahout-Quality #2264 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/2264/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/2264/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
